  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Transmutation (or Enhancement); <strong>CL</strong> 6th; <strong>Price</strong> 2,000 gp, <strong>Weight</strong> -</p>\n<p>This special ability may only be applied to weapons that can only be used against creatures of a particular size or range of sizes, such as a mancatcher or net. A stretching weapon is usable against creatures of any size category.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Magic Arms and Armor, masterwork transformation or Enhancement sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 1,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-magic-items#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
